    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuwinji, E polo, man icik ithi, E ng’om; kum Yehova yero kumae: Agwoko man atungo nyithindho, e gijai ira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koni dhiang’ ung’eyo won, man kana ng’eyo dero pa won; ento Israel ung’eyo ngo, dhanu para pido lembe ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A thek mi dubo, dhanu ma kier unurogi, kodhi mi jutim rac, nyithindho m’utimo gin mi nyoth mire! giweko Yehova, gicayu Ng’atu Maleng’ mir Israel, gikoc man gicoro cen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuyenyo jugoiwu asu nedi, ketho wujai kendo kendo? wie dho lith, man adunde dho voc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ugambre i die tielo cil kum wie ubedo bo moko mbe i ie; ento lero, man wil, ku wang’goc ma nyen: jumwono wang’gi ngo, kadi jutwiogi de ngo, kadi juyomogi ku mo de ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’om mu bedo ni uvuru; adhura mu juwang’u ku mac; ng’om mu, juwirok ucame i vutwu, man ebedo ni uvuru, calu juwirok ung’ielo gin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Nyasayuni juweko calu odkur i podho mir ulok, calu odkur i podho mir ukuju, calu adhura ma jutieko kud ali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tha 19:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rum 9:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tek Yehova mir udul kuweko iwa nyathi dong’ dhanu moko ngo, kuno di wabedo calu Sodoma, kuno di wabedo calu Gomora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuwinj lembe pa Yehova, wu jubim mi Sodoma; wucik ithwu kum cik pa Mungu mwa, wu dhanu mi Gomora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.5.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amo 5:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.5.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Udul lam mu en e ang’o ira? Yehova wacu: lam m’awang’a mi nyogi rombe, ku mio mi lim ma jukakugi ku cam uroma; man anyong’a nega ngo kum rim thwoni dhiang’, kadi mi nyithi rombe, kadi mi nyogi diegi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinde ma wubino nyuthru i wang’a, ng’a m’ulwong’o maeni i cingwu, ma nia wunyon lelagang’ para? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kud wukel lam ma ie nanu kendo; udok ma ng’wice ng’ar en e ginmajudagu ira; dwi ma por ku sabatu, man lwong’o mi cokri, acopo kude ngo: en e kier, cil cokri mi rwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dwi ma por mu man agba mu ma juketho ng’eyong’ec para dagu; gi gin mir ang’abacwiny ira; aol ku cirogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kinde ma wuthang’u cingwu, abipanu wang’a iwu; eyo, kinde ma wutimo rwo dupa, abiwinjo ngo: cingwu pong’ ku rimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wujom, wudwokru leng’; wukab dubo mi giratima mu cen kud i nyim wang’a; wuwek timo rac; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wuponj ng’eyo timo ber; wuyeny pokolembe, wukony ju ma jusendo, wupok lembe mi kic, wucung kum dhaku ma cware tho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubin kawono, man wek waporu lembe karacelo, Yehova wacu: kadok dubo mu bedo kwar ngbo, gibibedo tar calu pei; kadok gi kwar calu rimo, gibibedo calu yuk rombe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tek wuwinjo man wuworo, wubicamu gin ma ber m’i ng’om: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento tek wukwero man wujai, palamularu bicamuwu kum dhu Yehova yero maeni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adhura mandha doko ni won asara mire ma! en ma naka epong’ ku pokolembe mire! naka bedopwe gonjo i ie, ento kawono junek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mola ma tar peri doko usau, pigulok peri ke ajeba ku pi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Judongomawijo peri gijai, man gi juwadi jukwo; kubang’gi kubang’gi ng’atuman umaru jamng’om, man elubo tok sukulia: e gipoko lembe mi kic ungo, kadok lembe pa dhaku ma cware tho de wok i bang’gi ngo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno Rwoth, Yehova mir udul, Ng’atu Matek mir Israel uwacu kumae, A, abijukra kum jusend para, man abiculo kwor kum judegina pira; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man abiloko cinga i kumi, man abikabu munyali peri pet, e abikabu usau peri ceke cen; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man abidwoko jupoklembe peri calu ma kwong’a, man juporlembe peri calu ma kwong’a: yo ku ng’eye jubilwong’i Adhura mi bedopwe, adhura mandha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jubiwaru Sayuni ku pokolembe, man jupare m’udwogo ku bedopwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento nyoth mi weg gondri ku judubo bibedo karacelo, man ju m’uweko Yehova bithum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum lewic binegogi kum bongu ma wuketho cwinywu i kume, man cwinywu bing’abre kum podho ma wufoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum wubibedo calu bongu ma ithe ner, man calu podho ma pi mbe kude. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man jutego bibedo calu thondh gonia, tic pare de calu bieimac; e gin ario de gibiwang’ karacelo, e ng’atu moko mbe ma binego maje.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
